{"context_through_frame": 83200, "data_kind": "scripted_target_behavior", "example_id": "A001", "messages": [{"audio_id": "U01", "content": "游戏里的不可靠叙事者到底是什么？和普通叙事有什么区别？", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A001.wav", "audio_sha256": "9519ce921a08eae864294d408208a0dad2bfd8039a6c4fa57744377eccee0c5f", "content": "把叙事者想成给玩家讲故事的镜头或声音。普通叙事通常默认讲述信息大体可信；不可靠叙事则提醒你：讲述者的认知、记忆或动机可能让信息失真，玩家要自己拼真相。", "frames": 256000, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U01"}
{"context_through_frame": 400640, "data_kind": "scripted_target_behavior", "example_id": "A002", "messages": [{"audio_id": "U01", "content": "游戏里的不可靠叙事者到底是什么？和普通叙事有什么区别？", "role": "user"}, {"audio_id": "A001", "content": "把叙事者想成给玩家讲故事的镜头或声音。普通叙事通常默认讲述信息大体可信；不可靠", "role": "assistant"}, {"audio_id": "BC01", "content": "嗯", "role": "user"}, {"audio_id": "A001", "content": "叙事则提醒你：讲述者的认知、记忆或动机可能让信息失真，玩家要自己拼真相。", "role": "assistant"}, {"audio_id": "U02", "content": "也就是说，叙事者是在骗玩家吗？", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A002.wav", "audio_sha256": "f11dbe43ee565129dee90ade94a3edf389f422b12e8a392c02deaeb4e9f176cb", "content": "不一定。角色可能故意撒谎，也可能记错、误解，甚至被游戏界面限制了视角。判", "frames": 131840, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U02"}
